## Stat-shaping reagents
reagent-name-rootbinder = rootbinder
reagent-desc-rootbinder = A dense tonic that toughens a plant's roots. Plants grow hardier and longer-lived and their genes settle, at the cost of potency and yield.
reagent-name-growth-accelerant = growth accelerant
reagent-desc-growth-accelerant = A sharp stimulant that makes plants mature and produce faster and chokes out weeds. It strains the plant's genes and burns through nutrients.
